      },
      "text": "4 November · Lagoons, Chiguana and Uyuni Salt Flats"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:936a34ccc6e7c635",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d6997e8dfd02b933e425984f3ad11229cb232f0aa5a14b1941fd4f4671cf1983",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9gaklw-h6zr38ss",
        "model": "OpenAI GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast. Continue by 4×4 past the Honda, Chiar Khota, Hedionda and Cañapa lagoons, the viewpoint at Ollagüe volcano and the Chiguana Salt Flat. Visit Uyuni, Colchani, the water springs known as Ojos de Agua and an island with giant cacti. A packed lunch is included. Transfer to Uyuni at the end of the day. The flight to La Paz is scheduled for the following day."
    },
